# Memory stress test - 10000 spheres distributed across the frame
Format 1920 1080 1
Display "stress_memory.png" "file" "rgb"
Projection "perspective" "fov" 60
PixelSamples 4 4
Option "statistics" "endofframe" 2

Translate 0 0 15
WorldBegin

LightSource "ambientlight" "intensity" 0.3
LightSource "distantlight" "intensity" 0.7 "from" [1 2 -1] "to" [0 0 0]

Surface "plastic"
